(text "1. SJ1 (VIO <- +3V3): close ONLY when no host drives J2-VIO." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 107 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4207f46e-a483-4f96-a497-595be1bad06c"))
(text "2. JP1: fit BOTH shunts (1-2, 3-4) to enable 120 ohm split termination; remove both to disable." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 114 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3cdd648d-cf34-4866-9c17-ea0f25a13335"))
(text "3. Input: 7-16 V DC, centre-positive. Reverse polarity blocked by D1; sustained >18 V trips F1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 121 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b3858f83-c9ab-4274-a646-51dbef42f068"))
(text "4. MCP2515 16 MHz bit timing (CNF1/CNF2/CNF3): 1M 00/83/01 | 500k 00/AE/01 | 250k 01/AE/01 | 125k 03/AE/01. Disable CLKOUT (CANCTRL.CLKEN=0)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a1f8e99-80c9-4612-bf94-8b01711e0673"))
(text "5. L2 DNP: R16/R17 0 ohm fitted. If L2 fitted, remove R16/R17." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 135 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7fb5df90-3247-46a5-95a7-ed1538359d21"))
(text "6. R4 (OSC2 series) 0 ohm; fit ~1 kohm only if crystal overdrive measured at VIO 5 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5e1ae96b-e1fc-43af-a3e0-a7fbb34c2c1b"))
